{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13769","headline":"险竿歌 · 顾况","name":"险竿歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宛陵女儿擘飞手，长竿横空上下走。\n已能轻险若平地，岂肯身爲一家妇。\n宛陵将士天下雄，一下定却长稍弓。\n翻身挂影恣腾蹋，反绾头髻盘旋风。\n盘旋风，撇飞鸟，惊猿遶，树枝褭。\n头上打鼓不闻时，手蹉脚跌蜘蛛丝。\n忽雷掣断流星尾，矐睒划破蚩尤旗。\n若不随仙作仙女，即应嫁贼生贼儿。\n中丞方略通变化，外户不扃从女嫁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13769.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13769","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}